        "text": "62.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 348.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Complete the sentences with words from A opposite."
      },
      {
        "y": 87.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 538.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 A light kiss on each cheek is the thing in some cultures when you meet someone you"
      },
      {
        "y": 99.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 152.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "know."
      },
      {
        "y": 111.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 519.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Some people don’t seem to follow any kind of when posting messages on social"
      },
      {
        "y": 123.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 372.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "network sites and often post offensive or bullying material."
      },
      {
        "y": 135.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 420.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 She was very and hardly looked at me when she replied."
      },
      {
        "y": 147.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 442.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Joanna and David always taught their children to have good ."
      },
      {
        "y": 159.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 527.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 We don’t stand on in this house – just help yourself to anything you want from the"
      },
      {
        "y": 171.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 154.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "fridge."
      },
      {
        "y": 183.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 494.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 I’m sick of your comments. It’s time you learnt to speak politely to people."
      },
      {
        "y": 195.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 189.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "You’re so rude!"
      },
      {
        "y": 207.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 506,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 For a young person, she’s very and old-fashioned in her ideas and behaviour."
      },
      {
        "y": 219.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 492.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The school considers it important that students should always address their teachers in"
      },
      {
        "y": 231.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 493.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "a manner. Anyone who behaves in a way will be reported to"
      },
      {
        "y": 243.8,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 179,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the Director."
      },
      {
        "y": 259.9,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "62.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 262.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 223.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Answer these questions."
      },
      {
        "y": 279.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 384.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Jamie was twitching all evening. Do you think he was relaxed?"
      },
      {
        "y": 291.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 514.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Kate sniffed at every comment I made at the meeting. How did Kate feel about my comments?"
      },
      {
        "y": 303.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 408.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Jack flinched when I touched his arm. Why do you think he flinched?"
      },
      {
        "y": 315.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 518.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The teenagers’ behaviour on the bus raised a few of the other passengers’ eyebrows. What must"
      },
      {
        "y": 327.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 298.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the teenagers’ behaviour have been like?"
      },
      {
        "y": 339.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 499.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Look at the photo; Meg’s smirking and Tanya’s beaming. Who does the speaker think looks"
      },
      {
        "y": 351.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 216.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "nicer – Meg or Tanya?"
      },
      {
        "y": 363.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 528.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 There was an occasional titter at the comedian’s jokes. Do you think the comedian was pleased at"
      },
      {
        "y": 375.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 248.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "how his jokes were received?"
      },
      {
        "y": 387.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 533.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 Ritva squirmed in her chair when Karl said her photo was in the paper. How do you think Ritva felt?"
      },
      {
        "y": 399.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 530.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Their children had dreadful table manners. How do you think the children behaved during meals?"
      },
      {
        "y": 411.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 304.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "What sorts of things did they probably do?"
      },
      {
        "y": 427.2,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "62.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 429.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 375.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Choose the best word to complete each of these sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 446.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 375.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Brendan sniffed / snorted with laughter all through the play."
      },
      {
        "y": 458.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 395.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Whenever I’m tired or nervous, my eyelid starts to twitch / flinch."
      },
      {
        "y": 470.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 475.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Don’t keep squirming / smirking in your chair like that – sit still and behave yourself."
      },
      {
        "y": 482.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 485.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The students twitched / tittered when the teacher tripped over the wastepaper basket."
      },
      {
        "y": 494.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 388.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 The dentist stopped drilling as soon as he felt me flinch / snort."
      },
      {
        "y": 506.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 436.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 She twitched / beamed with happiness all through the wedding ceremony."
      },
      {
